    "['ipv6 pim [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols pim interface <interface-name> mode sparse', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the Cisco `ipv6 pim sparse-mode` command:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols pim interface <interface-name> mode sparse\\n##\\n\\nNote: You would need to replace `<interface-name>` with the actual Juniper interface name (e.g., `ge-1/0/0.0`). The Juniper command needs to be applied for each interface where PIM sparse mode is required.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols pim interface <interface-name> mode sparse'}]]": 1,
